WEBVTT

00:00:10.659 --> 00:00:14.996
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Times Square is the center of New York’s theater district.

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:24.409
Sydney Harbour Bridge and the famous opera house are iconic images of Australia.

00:00:27.391 --> 00:00:32.378
Hyde Park in central London has 4,000 trees, a lake,

00:00:32.725 --> 00:00:36.330
and a memorial to Diana, Princess of Wales.

00:00:39.992 --> 00:00:44.303
Edinburgh Castle stands on a rock above the city and

00:00:44.328 --> 00:00:47.956
is one of Scotland’s most popular tourist attractions.

00:00:51.028 --> 00:00:54.018
Wall Street, in the business district of New York,

00:00:54.376 --> 00:00:57.131
is home to the New York Stock Exchange.

00:01:01.095 --> 00:01:05.628
The National Gallery is London’s most famous art museum.